<title>UK: Enterprise Inns sees Q1 results in line.</title>
<headline>Enterprise Inns sees Q1 results in line.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Independent pub company Enterprise Inns said on Tuesday that results for the first quarter of the current year had been in line with its expectations.</p>
<p>&quot;The business of John Labatt (UK) Ltd which was acquired in June 1996 has been fully integrated and the anticipated increase in profitability is being realised,&quot; acting chairman Keith Millar told the company's annual meeting.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
